WEBVTT

00:02.800 --> 00:04.940
This is Doctor Elias Vale.

00:04.940 --> 00:09.648
If this recording has opened, the archive has accepted my name.

00:09.648 --> 00:12.645
The Department did not discover the signal.

00:12.645 --> 00:16.925
It built a room where the signal could remember us.

00:16.925 --> 00:19.921
My personnel number is not an identity.

00:19.921 --> 00:21.633
It is a date.

00:21.633 --> 00:25.057
Look for the day I entered the programme.
